OL,4,G1600FComposer of the Week: Schutz
OL,5,     GDonald Macleod sees Schutz endure
OL,6,     Gthe death of his wife, after only
OL,7,     Gsix years of marriage, and
OL,8,     Gexplores the music he composed to
OL,9,     Gmark her parting.
OL,10,G1700FIn Tune
OL,11,     GPetroc Trelawny welcomes
OL,12,     Gviolinist Jennifer Pike and
OL,13,     Gsoprano Danielle de Niese to the
OL,14,     Gstudio, as they both perform live
OL,15,     Gin 80A.
OL,16,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,17,     GHalf an hour of back-to-back
OL,18,     Gclassical music including works
OL,19,     Gby Gabriel Faure, Barbara
OL,20,     GStrozzi, Florence Price and Ruth
OL,21,     GGipps.
